      "dataStream": "Weekly Status Report\rOne page a week. The reader should grasp the situation in a minute, without having to ask anything.\rPeriod\r\rWhat moved forward\rResults, not activities. \"Sign-up is live\" says more than \"I worked on sign-up\".\rWhat got stuck\rWhat did not move and why. Hiding this only postpones the problem.\rRisks\rWhat is not a problem yet but could become one. Better flagged early.\rI need help with\rDecisions, access or people that someone else has to unblock.\rNext week\r\r\n",
